そうだ、人類対化け物やね！化け物担当サラマンダー担当はちちめらいくらじゃん！
That's right, humanity versus monsters! Monster representative Salamander representative Achichi Mela, right?

54
00:07:36,036 --> 00:07:42,196
人類対サラマンダーの戦いとしても過言ではありませんのじゃ！人類対サラマンダーの戦いって言っても過言ではありませんのじゃ！
It's no exaggeration to say it's a battle between humanity and salamanders! Even if you call it a battle between humanity and salamanders, it's no exaggeration!

55
00:07:42,396 --> 00:07:46,936
