Indeed, that Miracchi looks strong.

668
00:52:44,690 --> 00:52:49,610
なんかほら、やっぱお面つけてたらさ、かっこいいし強そうじゃん。
Look, if you wear a mask, it looks cool and strong, right?

669
00:52:50,430 --> 00:52:51,230
