As for me, I'll go first.

676
00:53:10,030 --> 00:53:11,010
そぴあルール分かる？
Sopia, do you know the rules?

677
00:53:11,170 --> 00:53:11,930
こっちも？あ、分かるよ。
Me too? Ah, I know them.

678
